      <a href="/products/pilegex" class="w-[260px] sm:w-[280px] shrink-0 snap-start group bg-white border border-gray-200 hover:border-[#c44900] rounded-xl p-4 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-xs hover:shadow-md transition-all">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
            <span class="font-bold text-sm text-[#c44900] font-deva">अर्शः उपशमन</span>
